Error [E0003]: Task-group parameter `max` is not supported
  --> tests/ui/task_group_parameter_label.jet:2:24
    |
  2 |     task.group workers(max: 2) {}
    |                        ^^^
 Why: The group parameter names the maximum number of active children
 Fix: Write `limit: n`
